1
00:00:01,382 --> 00:00:02,550
KATARA: Water...

2
00:00:03,760 --> 00:00:04,928
Earth...

3
00:00:05,678 --> 00:00:07,013
Fire...

4
00:00:07,805 --> 00:00:09,182
Air.

5
00:00:10,099 --> 00:00:14,103
Long ago, the four nations
lived together in harmony.

6
00:00:14,354 --> 00:00:17,690
Then everything changed
when the Fire Nation attacked.

7
00:00:18,608 --> 00:00:21,486
Only the Avatar,
master of all four elements,

8
00:00:21,569 --> 00:00:22,570
could stop them.

9
00:00:22,654 --> 00:00:24,614
But when the world
needed him most,

10
00:00:24,697 --> 00:00:25,698
he vanished.

11
00:00:26,074 --> 00:00:27,367
100 years passed,

12
00:00:27,450 --> 00:00:29,994
and my brother and I
discovered the new Avatar―

13
00:00:30,078 --> 00:00:31,704
An airbender named Aang.

14
00:00:31,788 --> 00:00:33,915
And although his airbending
skills are great,

15
00:00:33,998 --> 00:00:36,668
He has a lot to learn before
he's ready to save anyone.

16
00:00:36,751 --> 00:00:37,752
AANG: Oof!

17
00:00:37,835 --> 00:00:40,797
But I believe Aang can save the world.

18
00:00:49,305 --> 00:00:50,515
We need to find King Bumi

19
00:00:50,598 --> 00:00:52,767
so Aang can learn
earthbending somewhere safe.

20
00:00:52,850 --> 00:00:54,769
MAN: Sounds like you're
headed to Omashu.

21
00:00:55,186 --> 00:00:59,983
I present to you the Earth Kingdom city
of Om― Oh, no.

22
00:01:00,400 --> 00:01:03,278
I guess I need to find someone else
to teach me earthbending.

23
00:01:03,361 --> 00:01:07,907
You need to find someone
who waits and listens before striking.

24
00:01:08,366 --> 00:01:11,911
In the swamp, we see
visions of people we've lost,

25
00:01:11,995 --> 00:01:13,079
people we loved.

26
00:01:13,413 --> 00:01:14,998
But what about my vision?

27
00:01:15,081 --> 00:01:16,583
It was someone I had never met.

28
00:01:26,551 --> 00:01:30,388
It's pricey, but I really do like it.

29
00:01:30,471 --> 00:01:33,600
Then you should get it.
You deserve something nice.

30
00:01:33,683 --> 00:01:34,976
I do, don't I?

31
00:01:35,351 --> 00:01:38,313
But no. It's too expensive. I shouldn't.

32
00:01:38,396 --> 00:01:39,731
All right. Then don't.

33
00:01:44,068 --> 00:01:45,987
You know what? I'm gonna get it.

34
00:01:47,113 --> 00:01:48,323
Psst, psst.

35
00:01:48,406 --> 00:01:50,158
Hey, you kids like earthbending?

36
00:01:50,241 --> 00:01:51,951
You like throwing rocks?

37
00:01:52,327 --> 00:01:55,496
Then check out
Master Yu's earthbending academy.

38
00:01:58,249 --> 00:02:00,209
AANG: Look. There's a coupon on the back.

39
00:02:00,376 --> 00:02:01,628
The first lesson is free.

40
00:02:02,003 --> 00:02:04,130
Who knows? This Master Yu could be

41
00:02:04,213 --> 00:02:06,507
the earthbending teacher
you've been looking for.

42
00:02:13,097 --> 00:02:14,599
( SNIFFS )

43
00:02:17,143 --> 00:02:18,770
Take your stances.

44
00:02:19,979 --> 00:02:23,441
Now strike as if you're punching
through your opponent's head.

45
00:02:25,026 --> 00:02:26,152
Hyah!

46
00:02:28,446 --> 00:02:31,240
So are you ready to commit
to more lessons?

47
00:02:31,324 --> 00:02:33,493
If you pay for the whole year
in advance,

48
00:02:33,576 --> 00:02:36,037
I'll bump you up
to the next belt.

49
00:02:39,582 --> 00:02:41,376
Eh, he's not the one.

50
00:02:42,293 --> 00:02:44,504
I think the Boulder
is gonna win back the belt

51
00:02:44,587 --> 00:02:45,713
at Earth Rumble 6.

52
00:02:45,797 --> 00:02:47,674
He's gonna have
to fight his way through

53
00:02:47,757 --> 00:02:50,927
the best earthbenders in the world
to even get a shot at the champ.

54
00:02:51,010 --> 00:02:54,013
Excuse me. But where is this
earthbending tournament exactly?

55
00:02:54,097 --> 00:02:55,598
It's on the island of Noneoya―

56
00:02:55,765 --> 00:02:57,141
None o' ya business.

57
00:02:57,225 --> 00:02:58,726
- Ha ha!
- Ha ha!

58
00:02:59,352 --> 00:03:01,604
Ha ha!

59
00:03:01,896 --> 00:03:04,440
Oh, I got to remember that one.

60
00:03:04,524 --> 00:03:05,775
I'll take care of this.

61
00:03:06,734 --> 00:03:08,736
Hey, strong guys, wait up.

62
00:03:10,988 --> 00:03:13,908
What was I thinking?
I don't need a new bag.

63
00:03:13,991 --> 00:03:16,035
Why'd you let me buy this?

64
00:03:17,286 --> 00:03:18,913
( PURRING )

65
00:03:19,497 --> 00:03:21,499
You ready to find an earthbending teacher,

66
00:03:21,582 --> 00:03:24,335
because we're going to Earth Rumble 6.

67
00:03:24,419 --> 00:03:26,129
How did you get them to tell you?

68
00:03:26,212 --> 00:03:28,047
Oh, a girl has her ways.

69
00:03:34,011 --> 00:03:35,555
( CROWD CHEERING )

70
00:03:36,806 --> 00:03:40,184
Hey, front row seats.
I wonder why no one else is sitting here.

71
00:03:41,060 --> 00:03:42,186
I guess that's why.

72
00:03:44,731 --> 00:03:45,940
( CHEERING GROWS LOUDER )

73
00:03:50,611 --> 00:03:53,114
Welcome to Earth Rumble 6.

74
00:03:53,573 --> 00:03:56,492
I am your host, Xin Fu.

75
00:03:56,951 --> 00:03:59,620
( SIGHS ) This is just
gonna be a bunch of guys

76
00:03:59,704 --> 00:04:01,581
chucking rocks at each other, isn't it?

77
00:04:01,664 --> 00:04:02,999
That's what I paid for.

78
00:04:03,416 --> 00:04:05,251
The rules are simple.

79
00:04:05,334 --> 00:04:07,295
Just knock the other guy out of the ring,

80
00:04:07,378 --> 00:04:08,880
and you win.

81
00:04:11,549 --> 00:04:12,717
( BELL RINGS )

82
00:04:12,800 --> 00:04:18,306
Round one― The Boulder
versus the Big Bad Hippo!

83
00:04:19,182 --> 00:04:20,641
( YELLS )

84
00:04:20,725 --> 00:04:25,021
Listen up, Hippo.
You may be big, but you ain't bad.

85
00:04:25,104 --> 00:04:29,025
The Boulder's gonna
win this in a landslide.

86
00:04:29,609 --> 00:04:32,069
Hippo mad!

87
00:04:35,698 --> 00:04:37,158
Hyah!

88
00:04:44,457 --> 00:04:46,793
XIN FU: Unbelievable,
ladies and gentlemen.

89
00:04:46,876 --> 00:04:48,628
The Hippo is rocking the Boulder.

90
00:05:03,059 --> 00:05:04,268
The Boulder wins.

91
00:05:04,352 --> 00:05:06,062
( CROWD CHEERS )

92
00:05:06,646 --> 00:05:07,897
How about the Boulder?

93
00:05:07,980 --> 00:05:09,273
He's got some good moves.

94
00:05:09,357 --> 00:05:12,944
I don't know. Bumi said I need a teacher
who listens to the earth.

95
00:05:13,277 --> 00:05:15,154
He's just listening
to his big muscles.

96
00:05:15,238 --> 00:05:16,531
What do you think, Sokka?

97
00:05:16,614 --> 00:05:18,658
Ha ha! Whoo!

98
00:05:18,825 --> 00:05:25,164
Next match, the Boulder
versus Fire Nation Man.

99
00:05:25,248 --> 00:05:27,458
( CROWD BOOS )

100
00:05:28,501 --> 00:05:30,586
Boo! Boo!

101
00:05:31,003 --> 00:05:32,463
Please do rise

102
00:05:32,547 --> 00:05:35,758
for Fire Nation national anthem.

103
00:05:35,842 --> 00:05:40,805
♪ Fire lord, my flame
burns for thee ♪

104
00:05:40,888 --> 00:05:42,306
( CROWD BOOING )

105
00:05:42,390 --> 00:05:45,059
Go back to the Fire Nation.

106
00:05:50,439 --> 00:05:52,358
No. No, please!

107
00:05:55,820 --> 00:05:57,572
Aah!

108
00:05:59,782 --> 00:06:01,409
Yeah! Whoo!

109
00:06:01,492 --> 00:06:04,370
The Boulder knows how
to put the hurt in the dirt.

110
00:06:04,453 --> 00:06:06,247
Yeah! Whoo!

111
00:06:06,747 --> 00:06:07,790
( ORGAN PLAYING )

112
00:06:10,293 --> 00:06:11,377
( BELL RINGS )

113
00:06:25,308 --> 00:06:29,228
XIN FU: Now the moment
you've all been waiting for―

114
00:06:29,312 --> 00:06:35,192
The Boulder versus your champion―
The Blind Bandit.

115
00:06:35,276 --> 00:06:36,736
( CROWD CHEERS )

116
00:06:36,819 --> 00:06:40,156
( CROWD CHANTING "BANDIT" )

117
00:06:40,239 --> 00:06:42,116
She can't really be blind.

118
00:06:42,199 --> 00:06:44,285
It's just part of her character, right?

119
00:06:44,368 --> 00:06:45,578
I think she is.

120
00:06:45,661 --> 00:06:46,704
I think she is...

121
00:06:46,787 --> 00:06:47,914
Going down!

122
00:06:50,082 --> 00:06:52,209
The Boulder feels conflicted

123
00:06:52,293 --> 00:06:55,087
about fighting a young blind girl.

124
00:06:55,171 --> 00:06:58,758
Sounds to me like you're scared, Boulder.

125
00:06:59,800 --> 00:07:02,511
The Boulder's over
his conflicted feelings,

126
00:07:02,595 --> 00:07:06,098
and now he's ready
to bury you in a rock-alanche.

127
00:07:06,557 --> 00:07:09,185
Whenever you're ready, the Pebble.

128
00:07:09,727 --> 00:07:11,187
Ha ha ha!

129
00:07:12,146 --> 00:07:13,439
( GIGGLES )

130
00:07:14,815 --> 00:07:15,858
Ha ha ha!

131
00:07:18,069 --> 00:07:19,236
It's on.

132
00:07:24,825 --> 00:07:26,285
( GROWLING )

133
00:07:26,369 --> 00:07:27,870
( GROWLING IN SLOW MOTION )

134
00:07:45,638 --> 00:07:46,639
Whoa!

135
00:07:47,098 --> 00:07:48,099
Ooh.

136
00:07:48,182 --> 00:07:50,184
Ooh!

137
00:07:56,440 --> 00:08:01,112
XIN FU: Your winner,
and still the champion, the Blind Bandit.

138
00:08:01,195 --> 00:08:04,824
( CRYING ) No!

139
00:08:05,408 --> 00:08:06,701
How did she do that?

140
00:08:07,243 --> 00:08:09,495
She waited and listened.

141
00:08:12,331 --> 00:08:14,709
To make things a little more interesting,

142
00:08:14,792 --> 00:08:17,545
I'm offering up this sack of gold pieces

143
00:08:17,628 --> 00:08:22,216
to anyone who can defeat
the Blind Bandit.

144
00:08:22,299 --> 00:08:25,928
What? No one dares to face her?

145
00:08:26,012 --> 00:08:27,346
I will.

146
00:08:31,934 --> 00:08:34,562
Go, Aang! Avenge the Boulder!

147
00:08:34,812 --> 00:08:37,523
Do people really want to see
two little girls

148
00:08:37,606 --> 00:08:38,774
fighting out here?

149
00:08:38,858 --> 00:08:40,943
CROWD: Ooh.

150
00:08:41,027 --> 00:08:42,611
I don't really want to fight you.

151
00:08:42,695 --> 00:08:44,155
I want to talk to you.

152
00:08:44,238 --> 00:08:46,323
Boo! No talking!

153
00:08:46,407 --> 00:08:47,742
Don't boo at him.

154
00:08:56,375 --> 00:08:58,669
Somebody's a little light on his feet.

155
00:08:58,753 --> 00:09:01,464
What's your fighting name,
the Fancy Dancer?

156
00:09:04,592 --> 00:09:06,052
Where'd you go?

157
00:09:06,844 --> 00:09:08,179
Please, wait.

158
00:09:08,262 --> 00:09:09,597
There you are.

159
00:09:11,682 --> 00:09:12,850
Aah!

160
00:09:20,024 --> 00:09:21,734
( CROWD CHEERS )

161
00:09:21,817 --> 00:09:23,069
Please listen!

162
00:09:23,152 --> 00:09:24,653
I need an earthbending teacher,

163
00:09:24,737 --> 00:09:26,489
and I think it's supposed to be you.

164
00:09:26,572 --> 00:09:28,657
Whoever you are, just leave me alone.

165
00:09:31,327 --> 00:09:32,495
Wait!

166
00:09:38,209 --> 00:09:39,627
( FANFARE )

167
00:09:40,461 --> 00:09:41,712
SOKKA: Way to go, champ.

168
00:09:49,178 --> 00:09:50,387
I got to admit,

169
00:09:50,471 --> 00:09:52,640
now I'm really glad I bought this bag.

170
00:09:52,723 --> 00:09:55,101
It matches the belt perfectly.

171
00:09:55,309 --> 00:09:57,061
That is a big relief.

172
00:09:57,144 --> 00:09:58,896
If we want to find the Blind Bandit,

173
00:09:58,979 --> 00:10:01,315
The earthbending academy
is a good place to start.

174
00:10:05,319 --> 00:10:07,655
Oh, great. You again.

175
00:10:08,739 --> 00:10:09,740
- Aah!
- Aah!

176
00:10:09,824 --> 00:10:11,075
Yeah. I didn't think so.

177
00:10:11,283 --> 00:10:12,493
Nicely done.

178
00:10:12,910 --> 00:10:15,538
Hey, you're the kid
who beat the Blind Bandit.

179
00:10:15,621 --> 00:10:17,081
AANG: We need to talk to her.

180
00:10:17,164 --> 00:10:18,749
Do you guys know where she lives?

181
00:10:18,958 --> 00:10:20,584
The Blind Bandit's a mystery.

182
00:10:20,668 --> 00:10:23,254
She shows up to fight,
then disappears.

183
00:10:24,338 --> 00:10:26,340
Let me handle this.

184
00:10:26,423 --> 00:10:28,134
You're not telling us everything.

185
00:10:28,509 --> 00:10:30,094
No, no. I swear it's true.

186
00:10:30,177 --> 00:10:32,930
No one knows where she goes
or who she really is.

187
00:10:33,055 --> 00:10:35,766
That's because we're asking
about the wrong person.

188
00:10:35,891 --> 00:10:38,811
In my vision, I saw a girl
in a white dress

189
00:10:38,894 --> 00:10:40,312
with a pet flying boar.

190
00:10:40,396 --> 00:10:41,605
Know anybody like that?

191
00:10:41,897 --> 00:10:45,109
Well, a flying boar
is the symbol of the Beifong family.

192
00:10:45,192 --> 00:10:46,902
They're the richest people in town,

193
00:10:46,986 --> 00:10:48,863
Probably the whole world.

194
00:10:48,946 --> 00:10:50,739
Yeah, but they don't have a daughter.

195
00:10:50,823 --> 00:10:53,450
A flying boar is good enough for me.
Let's check it out.

196
00:10:53,868 --> 00:10:55,578
Yeah. You better leave.

197
00:10:55,828 --> 00:10:58,330
Hey. I got my eye on you.

198
00:10:59,165 --> 00:11:00,541
Water tribe.

199
00:11:01,959 --> 00:11:03,085
I'm telling you,

200
00:11:03,169 --> 00:11:05,296
the Boulder was standing right there.

201
00:11:05,379 --> 00:11:08,716
I saw the kid strike,
but there was no earthbending.

202
00:11:08,799 --> 00:11:10,467
Nothing made contact.

203
00:11:10,551 --> 00:11:12,803
The Blind Bandit
just fell out of the ring.

204
00:11:13,137 --> 00:11:14,513
She must have took a dive

205
00:11:14,597 --> 00:11:16,432
and split the money with the kid.

206
00:11:20,186 --> 00:11:21,437
( YELLS )

207
00:11:21,520 --> 00:11:23,314
Nobody cheats Xin Fu.

208
00:11:30,070 --> 00:11:32,823
That's the flying boar
from my vision. Come on.

209
00:11:42,833 --> 00:11:44,376
( KIDS SCREAMING )

210
00:11:48,255 --> 00:11:50,466
What are you doing here,
twinkle toes?

211
00:11:50,883 --> 00:11:52,218
How did you know it was me?

212
00:11:52,301 --> 00:11:55,095
Don't answer to twinkle toes.
It's not manly.

213
00:11:55,179 --> 00:11:57,264
You're the one whose bag
matches his belt.

214
00:11:57,932 --> 00:11:59,141
How did you find me?

215
00:11:59,225 --> 00:12:01,143
Well, a crazy king told me I had to find

216
00:12:01,227 --> 00:12:03,187
the earthbender who listens to the earth.

217
00:12:03,270 --> 00:12:05,564
And then I had a vision
in a magic swamp, and―

218
00:12:05,648 --> 00:12:07,316
What Aang is trying to say

219
00:12:07,399 --> 00:12:10,653
is he's the Avatar, and if he doesn't
master earthbending soon,

220
00:12:10,736 --> 00:12:12,655
he won't be able
to defeat the Fire Lord.

221
00:12:13,030 --> 00:12:16,200
Not my problem.
Now get out of here

222
00:12:16,283 --> 00:12:17,701
or I'll call the guards.

223
00:12:17,910 --> 00:12:20,204
Look, we all have to do our part
to win this war.

224
00:12:20,287 --> 00:12:22,957
And yours is to teach
Aang earthbending.

225
00:12:23,457 --> 00:12:25,668
Guards! Guards, help!

226
00:12:28,921 --> 00:12:30,297
Toph, what happened?

227
00:12:30,631 --> 00:12:34,301
I thought I heard someone. I got scared.

228
00:12:34,677 --> 00:12:37,471
You know your father doesn't want you
wandering the grounds

229
00:12:37,554 --> 00:12:39,139
without supervision, Toph.

230
00:12:44,979 --> 00:12:46,355
( SNIFFS )

231
00:12:47,523 --> 00:12:48,565
I'm pleased to hear

232
00:12:48,691 --> 00:12:51,151
that Toph's private lessons
are going well,

233
00:12:51,527 --> 00:12:54,738
but I want to be sure
she's not trying anything too dangerous.

234
00:12:55,114 --> 00:12:56,782
Absolutely not.

235
00:12:56,991 --> 00:12:59,243
I'm keeping her at the beginner's level―

236
00:12:59,326 --> 00:13:02,288
Basic forms and breathing exercises only.

237
00:13:02,705 --> 00:13:03,914
Very good.

238
00:13:04,456 --> 00:13:07,835
Excuse me, sir,
but you have a visitor.

239
00:13:08,419 --> 00:13:09,962
Who thinks they are so important

240
00:13:10,045 --> 00:13:12,047
they can just come
to my home unannounced?

241
00:13:12,131 --> 00:13:14,967
Uh, the Avatar, sir.

242
00:13:23,809 --> 00:13:25,144
( CHOMPING NOISILY )

243
00:13:26,854 --> 00:13:28,772
Blow on it. It's too hot for her.

244
00:13:28,856 --> 00:13:29,857
Allow me.

245
00:13:33,027 --> 00:13:34,194
Oh, my.

246
00:13:34,445 --> 00:13:38,073
Avatar Aang, it's an honor
to have you visit us.

247
00:13:38,699 --> 00:13:42,578
In your opinion, how much longer
do you think the war will last?

248
00:13:42,828 --> 00:13:45,998
I'd like to defeat
the Fire Lord by the end of summer,

249
00:13:46,457 --> 00:13:47,791
but I can't do that

250
00:13:47,875 --> 00:13:50,252
without finding
an earthbending teacher first.

251
00:13:50,794 --> 00:13:54,048
Well, Master Yu
is the finest teacher in the land.

252
00:13:54,131 --> 00:13:56,258
He's been teaching Toph
since she was little.

253
00:13:56,633 --> 00:13:58,635
Then she must be a great earthbender,

254
00:13:59,553 --> 00:14:02,014
Probably good enough to teach
someone else. Ow!

255
00:14:05,768 --> 00:14:07,728
Toph is still
learning the basics.

256
00:14:08,395 --> 00:14:11,148
Yes. And, sadly,
because of her blindness,

257
00:14:11,231 --> 00:14:13,525
I don't think she will ever
become a true master.

258
00:14:15,027 --> 00:14:17,988
Oh, I'm sure she's better
than you think she is.

259
00:14:18,072 --> 00:14:19,073
Uh!

260
00:14:29,666 --> 00:14:32,127
( SNEEZES )

261
00:14:34,630 --> 00:14:36,215
What's your problem?

262
00:14:36,298 --> 00:14:37,800
What's your problem?

263
00:14:40,636 --> 00:14:43,639
Well, shall we move to the living room

264
00:14:43,722 --> 00:14:45,099
for dessert, then?

265
00:14:48,560 --> 00:14:49,645
Good night, buddy.

266
00:14:52,231 --> 00:14:53,315
Hyah!

267
00:14:53,607 --> 00:14:56,527
Relax. Look, I'm sorry about dinner.

268
00:14:56,777 --> 00:14:58,404
Let's call it a truce, ok?

269
00:15:01,156 --> 00:15:04,827
Even though I was born blind,
I've never had a problem seeing.

270
00:15:06,495 --> 00:15:07,955
I see with earthbending.

271
00:15:08,497 --> 00:15:10,707
It's kind of like
seeing with my feet.

272
00:15:11,166 --> 00:15:13,252
I feel the vibrations
in the earth,

273
00:15:13,544 --> 00:15:15,754
and I can see where everything is―

274
00:15:16,255 --> 00:15:20,717
You, that tree, even those ants.

275
00:15:23,762 --> 00:15:25,097
That's amazing.

276
00:15:25,180 --> 00:15:27,057
My parents don't understand.

277
00:15:28,183 --> 00:15:30,519
They've always treated me
like I was helpless.

278
00:15:30,978 --> 00:15:33,230
Is that why you became
the Blind Bandit?

279
00:15:33,313 --> 00:15:34,314
Yeah.

280
00:15:34,940 --> 00:15:37,109
Then why stay here
where you're not happy?

281
00:15:37,192 --> 00:15:38,902
They're my parents.

282
00:15:38,986 --> 00:15:40,696
Where else am I supposed to go?

283
00:15:42,114 --> 00:15:43,365
You could come with us.

284
00:15:43,449 --> 00:15:46,493
Yeah. You guys get to go
wherever you want.

285
00:15:46,577 --> 00:15:50,164
No one telling you
what to do― That's the life.

286
00:15:50,956 --> 00:15:52,416
It's just not my life.

287
00:15:55,878 --> 00:15:57,087
We're being ambushed.

288
00:16:14,688 --> 00:16:17,983
I think you kids
owe me some money.

289
00:16:24,281 --> 00:16:26,617
Whoever took Aang
and Toph left this.

290
00:16:27,493 --> 00:16:29,369
"If you want to see
your daughter again,

291
00:16:29,453 --> 00:16:31,580
bring 500 gold pieces
to the arena."

292
00:16:31,663 --> 00:16:34,208
It's signed "Xin Fu
and the Boulder."

293
00:16:34,291 --> 00:16:35,626
I can't believe it.

294
00:16:36,126 --> 00:16:38,337
I have the Boulder's autograph!

295
00:16:40,130 --> 00:16:43,175
Master Yu, I need you
to help me get my daughter back.

296
00:16:43,258 --> 00:16:44,593
We're going with you.

297
00:16:45,928 --> 00:16:47,137
Poor Toph!

298
00:16:47,471 --> 00:16:48,847
She must be so scared.

299
00:16:49,389 --> 00:16:51,892
You think you're so tough,
why don't you come up here

300
00:16:51,975 --> 00:16:53,977
so I can smack that
grin off your face?

301
00:16:54,061 --> 00:16:55,312
I'm not smiling.

302
00:16:55,979 --> 00:16:57,439
SOKKA: Toph!

303
00:16:58,106 --> 00:17:00,192
Here's your money.
Now, let them go.

304
00:17:11,119 --> 00:17:12,579
What about Aang?

305
00:17:12,663 --> 00:17:16,542
I think the Fire Nation
will pay a hefty price for the Avatar.

306
00:17:16,917 --> 00:17:19,336
Now get out of my ring.

307
00:17:35,978 --> 00:17:37,604
Go. I'll be ok.

308
00:17:40,983 --> 00:17:44,319
Toph, there's too many of them.
We need an earthbender.

309
00:17:44,403 --> 00:17:45,904
We need you.

310
00:17:45,988 --> 00:17:47,864
My daughter
is blind.

311
00:17:47,948 --> 00:17:51,493
She is blind and tiny and helpless
and fragile.

312
00:17:51,618 --> 00:17:53,078
She cannot help you.

313
00:17:53,579 --> 00:17:55,205
Yes, I can.

314
00:18:02,379 --> 00:18:03,714
Let him go.

315
00:18:04,214 --> 00:18:06,592
I beat you all before,
and I'll do it again.

316
00:18:07,009 --> 00:18:09,970
The Boulder takes
issue with that comment.

317
00:18:12,889 --> 00:18:14,016
Wait.

318
00:18:19,938 --> 00:18:21,106
They're mine.

319
00:19:07,069 --> 00:19:08,153
Ugh.

320
00:19:09,863 --> 00:19:10,864
Hit it harder!

321
00:19:10,947 --> 00:19:11,948
I'm trying.

322
00:19:45,524 --> 00:19:47,025
Aah!

323
00:19:47,150 --> 00:19:49,319
( GROWLING )

324
00:19:50,737 --> 00:19:53,448
( GROWLING )

325
00:19:56,493 --> 00:19:58,578
( EARTHBENDER YELLS )

326
00:20:13,719 --> 00:20:16,805
I never knew.
Your daughter's amazing.

327
00:20:22,227 --> 00:20:23,812
( NECK CRACKING )

328
00:21:08,857 --> 00:21:13,111
She's the greatest
earthbender I've ever seen.

329
00:21:14,738 --> 00:21:16,907
Dad, I know it's probably hard

330
00:21:17,032 --> 00:21:18,450
for you to see me this way,

331
00:21:18,533 --> 00:21:20,702
but the obedient little
helpless blind girl

332
00:21:20,827 --> 00:21:22,871
that you think I am
just isn't me.

333
00:21:23,455 --> 00:21:24,790
I love fighting.

334
00:21:25,373 --> 00:21:26,917
I love being an earthbender.

335
00:21:27,626 --> 00:21:29,920
And I'm really, really good at it.

336
00:21:30,796 --> 00:21:32,923
I know I've kept my life secret from you,

337
00:21:33,006 --> 00:21:35,884
but you were keeping me secret
from the whole world.

338
00:21:35,967 --> 00:21:37,552
You were doing it to protect me.

339
00:21:38,053 --> 00:21:40,847
But I'm 12 years old,
and I've never had a real friend.

340
00:21:42,974 --> 00:21:44,768
So now that you see
who I really am,

341
00:21:44,851 --> 00:21:47,312
I hope it doesn't change
the way you feel about me.

342
00:21:47,395 --> 00:21:50,524
Of course it doesn't change
the way I feel about you, Toph.

343
00:21:51,066 --> 00:21:52,651
It's made me realize something.

344
00:21:53,318 --> 00:21:54,361
It has?

345
00:21:54,653 --> 00:21:58,323
Yes. I've let you have
far too much freedom.

346
00:21:58,448 --> 00:22:00,867
From now on,
you will be cared for and guarded

347
00:22:00,951 --> 00:22:02,327
24 hours a day.

348
00:22:02,410 --> 00:22:03,537
But, Dad―

349
00:22:03,620 --> 00:22:06,456
MRS. BEIFONG: We are doing this
for your own good, Toph.

350
00:22:06,540 --> 00:22:09,292
MR. BEIFONG: Please escort
the Avatar and his friends out.

351
00:22:09,793 --> 00:22:12,003
They are no longer
welcome here.

352
00:22:12,504 --> 00:22:14,089
I'm sorry, Toph.

353
00:22:14,172 --> 00:22:17,425
I'm sorry, too.
Good-bye, Aang.

354
00:22:22,556 --> 00:22:24,641
Don't worry. We'll find you a teacher.

355
00:22:25,267 --> 00:22:28,103
There are plenty of amazing
earthbenders out there.

356
00:22:28,228 --> 00:22:29,646
Not like her.

357
00:22:36,069 --> 00:22:37,445
( DISTANT PANTING )

358
00:22:39,573 --> 00:22:41,408
Toph, what are you doing here?

359
00:22:41,741 --> 00:22:43,410
My dad changed his mind.

360
00:22:43,493 --> 00:22:46,121
He said I was free to travel the world.

361
00:22:47,289 --> 00:22:49,416
Well, we'd better get out of here

362
00:22:49,499 --> 00:22:51,459
before your dad changes his mind again.

363
00:22:51,918 --> 00:22:53,336
Good idea.

364
00:22:53,420 --> 00:22:55,463
You're gonna be a great teacher, Toph.

365
00:22:55,922 --> 00:22:58,758
Speaking of which,
I want to show you something.

366
00:22:58,884 --> 00:22:59,885
Ok.

367
00:23:00,343 --> 00:23:01,511
Aah!

368
00:23:02,053 --> 00:23:03,346
Now we're even.

369
00:23:03,930 --> 00:23:05,265
Um, I'll take the belt back.

370
00:23:08,643 --> 00:23:09,644
Ow!

371
00:23:10,103 --> 00:23:11,313
SOKKA: Sorry.

372
00:23:13,607 --> 00:23:15,817
MR. BEIFONG: I know you two
are very different,

373
00:23:15,901 --> 00:23:18,737
but I believe you have
a common interest.

374
00:23:23,116 --> 00:23:25,327
The Avatar has kidnapped my daughter.

375
00:23:25,785 --> 00:23:30,290
I want you to do whatever it takes
to bring her home.
